# tccompare must also compare the length of both strings
Wetonan tulis: (['secret'] tccompare: ['']), baris-anyar.
Wetonan tulis: ([''] tccompare: ['secret']), baris-anyar.
Wetonan tulis: (['secret'] tccompare: ['sec']), baris-anyar.
Wetonan tulis: (['sec'] tccompare: ['secret']), baris-anyar.
Wetonan tulis: (['secret'] tccompare: ['secret']), baris-anyar.
Wetonan tulis: ([''] tccompare: ['']), baris-anyar.
